{
  "title": "Nutritious Velvety Malaysian Chicken Tagine",
  "description": "This dish is a funky and velvety Malaysian recipe featuring powdered sugar and cooked in a tagine, with ayurvedic-sattvic-friendly ingredients to provide an energizing meal.",
  "cuisine": "Malaysian",
